WEBVTT

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:17.390
I've been able to talk to Hiyama naturally now.

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:20.430
It's been a full year since then.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:27.580
I had a very sad dream the day before.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:32.770
I'm first!

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.050
I'm sorry.

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:52.290
What a terrible face.

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:54.650
What was that all about, Hiyama?

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:56.050
You surprised me.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:02.180
Hey Aoi, are you going to cram school after class?

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:03.670
No, why?

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:05.590
Want to go home?

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:06.950
Hmm?

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:09.140
What do you mean?

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:10.830
I mean together...

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.300
Eh!?

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:21.370
What is it?

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:23.890
This isn't candid camera, right?

00:01:25.010 --> 00:01:26.370
No!

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:27.870
Really?

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:30.110
If you don't want to, that's fine.

00:01:30.110 --> 00:01:31.930
No, it's fine!

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:33.620
I'm really happy!

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:36.540
Then after I'm done with my class committee meeting.

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:37.520
Okay.

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:40.510
Aoi Yui, age 12.

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:44.910
This is the first time my boyfriend wants us to walk home together.

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:35.420
Eh!? Hiyama wants to walk home together with you?

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:36.030
Yes.

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:38.930
Wow! Such boyfriend-girlfriend vibes!

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:40.470
You did it!

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:43.510
I was surprised, too.

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:49.710
I see, that's what it is.

00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:55.410
Yui has been applying lip balm so intently now.

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:58.640
Preparing for a kiss, no?

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:02.090
Kiss!?

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:05.060
No, you're wrong.

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:07.350
Oh really?

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:13.530
Um, that's why we can't go home together today.

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:20.120
There's someone who needs my love advice today.

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:22.690
Then I'll be going too...

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:29.510
Going home with Takao, maybe?

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:34.820
No! Takao is going to the class committee meeting with me!

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:41.180
Oh dear, Hanabi.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:43.420
What's with that handkerchief?

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:48.210
It's a Rabbit Panda handkerchief. Isn't it cute?

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:52.000
You're already in sixth grade. What's with a cartoon one?

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.400
How lame.

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:54.380
Lame?

00:04:55.020 --> 00:05:00.580
Really, why did Takao go out with such a child?

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:03.570
I can't understand at all!

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:10.210
You're so different from me, Hanabi.

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:15.310
You're not very cute at all and your figure sucks.

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:21.290
I worry about Takao even thinking of you as a girl.

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:26.240
He said I was as cute as a puppy!

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:27.620
Puppy?

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:31.740
W-What?

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:37.180
So he sees you as a pet instead of a girl?

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:40.360
But I'm his girlfriend!

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:45.410
Then has he told you what he liked about you?

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.520
W-Well...

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:55.600
You're going out with him but you never found out why?

00:05:56.210 --> 00:06:01.490
What part of me does Takao like?

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:10.050
My sister told me that she likes wild boys.

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:12.200
Wild?

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:15.780
That's too wild!

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:23.630
Did Hiyama ever tell you what he likes about you?

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:27.650
No, he hasn't said anything.

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:33.560
But he wants to walk home with you today.

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:34.550
Yes.

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:40.440
Hiyama really likes you, even when he can't say it.

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:41.700
Yep.

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:44.200
Don't tell me...

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:47.800
That was interesting!

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:48.310
Yeah!

00:06:48.310 --> 00:06:50.000
I heard he's been playing soccer.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.590
Really? Let's join in!

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:52.430
Okay!

00:06:57.620 --> 00:07:00.940
It's been a year since that day.

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:03.600
I'm first!

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:08.440
I'm sorry.

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:16.430
She was...

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:24.310
Time for Class 5-2's Center election!

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:30.250
The most popular girl in this class will become the Center!

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:34.880
Here we go! One, two...

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:39.130
Eh? Me?

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:42.260
Please tell us how you feel on becoming the Center.

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:46.540
Um, I'm really happy that I'm popular,

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:49.490
but I already have someone in mind.

00:08:00.610 --> 00:08:03.000
Look at the lunch menu!

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.680
Thursday is...

00:08:04.680 --> 00:08:06.780
Yes! Fried chicken!

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:08.070
But how about Tuesday?

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.640
Carrot salad.

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:16.300
Hey, Takao, what kind of girl do you like?

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.600
Hamburg steak! Ramen! Curry!

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:24.270
A girl like a puppy is really cute.

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:30.390
A puppy? I've been called that many times before!

00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:34.130
Ayase is such an interesting girl.

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:41.920
How about the girl we wouldn't like to go out with the most?

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:43.830
What's with the boys? That's terrible!

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.050
I can't believe them!

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:49.540
What? You jealous because you weren't chosen as the Center?

00:08:49.540 --> 00:08:51.170
That's not it!

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:57.810
Well, the girl I most likely won't go out with is you, Sakura!

00:08:57.810 --> 00:08:58.910
That's terrible!

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:01.390
Tch.

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:03.070
This isn't fun at all.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:05.270
Are you okay?

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:08.310
Wow, what a pain.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:12.230
That's so sly, crying in public to gain sympathy.

00:09:12.470 --> 00:09:13.820
You're right.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:15.370
Right?

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:18.310
All girls need to do is cry and everything is forgiven!

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:22.360
I thought so, but...

00:09:25.110 --> 00:09:30.160
Eh? Do you like someone like Aoi, Hiyama?

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:31.890
N-No!

00:09:31.890 --> 00:09:33.440
How's that possible?

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:34.910
Hmph!

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:44.120
So what did you want to talk about?

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:48.330
It's rare seeing you ask for love advice.

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:50.570
That's not it.

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:55.600
Then what do you need to ask me about?

00:09:57.140 --> 00:10:01.160
Aoi seemed kind of weird today.

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:03.920
Why are you asking about her?

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:14.670
Um, I saw Aoi this morning look at her Mother's Day picture.

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:16.330
And then...

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:17.820
And then?

00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:22.920
I thought she was scolded by her mom yesterday or something.

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:26.100
If it's nothing, then that's fine.

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:33.740
Hiyama, don't you dare ask about her mom scolding her.

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.940
Why?

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:40.430
Yui's mom is gone.

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:57.140
I have a question, Yui!

00:10:57.140 --> 00:10:59.250
What is bread that you can't eat?

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.880
Huh? A pan-da? (Pan = bread)

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:01.770
She's...

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:01.820
Nope!
She's...

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:02.470
Nope!

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:04.620
How can she smile like that?

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:09.390
If you say anything weird to Yui, then you better watch out!

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:10.840
I won't.

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:12.150
Don't forget!

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.460
Yo!

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:19.510
I never really talked to her before.

00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:21.050
I won't say anything.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:30.430
W-Why do you have this notebook, Takao?

00:11:30.430 --> 00:11:32.340
It was in my desk.

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:34.030
Eh!?

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:36.320
Did you read what's inside!?

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:38.890
You like macho men?

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:42.960
Eh!?

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:47.490
This is... Um...

00:11:48.990 --> 00:11:53.010
I thought this spy I saw in this movie was super cool!

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:55.740
And I wanted to draw him...

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:00.040
Why are you laughing?

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:04.740
Well, I just think you're like a puppy.

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:14.050
She's laughing again.

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:15.820
Bring it on!

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:17.220
Three strikes!

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:19.610
Home run!

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:25.990
Oh no!

00:12:25.990 --> 00:12:28.330
She'll start crying!

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:34.920
Hey!

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:37.820
Be serious and clean, boys!

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:40.480
Yui, are you okay?

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:43.710
Yeah, I'm fine. It just surprised me a bit.

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:56.030
I think I'm fine with anyone, just not Aoi.

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:59.070
Aoi gives off this scary vibe sometimes.

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:00.840
Just like my mom.

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:11.240
Hiyama, can you throw away the trash?

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:13.390
Hey.

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:17.090
Don't smile at me.

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:21.860
I don't want to see you smile like that.

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:24.990
What did you say!?

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:29.380
Your smile pisses me off!

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:32.820
Huh!? What do you mean!?

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:40.350
I screwed up.

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:44.650
Jeez, I'm so childish.

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:49.530
I wanted to cheer her up and tell her not to force herself.

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:51.920
Is there another way to tell her?

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:57.060
Kazuma! What have you been blabbering on about?

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:58.930
Come over here already!

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:07.440
Jeez, how can you make stew with no milk?

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:09.420
That's too careless.

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:15.500
Hey, Mom! Higher, higher!

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:23.890
Wow! So high!

00:14:23.890 --> 00:14:26.230
Mama! Look! Look!

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:27.490
Aoi...

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:48.600
Hey, wait!

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:49.770
What?

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:52.670
You're going to make fun of me again, right?

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:55.010
That's not it.

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:56.780
Then what is it?

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:01.500
Um...

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:03.910
I'm sorry about today.

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:14.430
So you have a bento box for dinner?

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:17.420
That Kyun-Kyun Convenience Store bento box is delicious.

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:18.540
Yeah.

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:23.030
We're having stew but we're out of milk. That's why I'm out.

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:25.770
Jeez, I can't really believe it.

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:30.020
Today my dad said he'll be late home.

00:15:30.020 --> 00:15:33.530
I thought making dinner was too bothersome.

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:34.840
I'm sorry.

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:37.640
Why are you apologizing?

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:38.580
Well...

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:42.550
I should be the one apologizing.

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:45.850
I'm sorry you had to see a weird side of me this morning.

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:48.930
It's not weird.

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:53.420
Crying isn't weird at all.

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:58.050
I don't understand too well, but you should cry all you want.

00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:00.150
Hiyama...

00:16:00.880 --> 00:16:04.010
It'll be such a pain if you cry at school.

00:16:04.430 --> 00:16:06.300
What did you say!?

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:10.130
"Such a pain!?"

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:12.980
Stop questioning everything I say!

00:16:12.980 --> 00:16:15.370
You started it!

00:16:19.690 --> 00:16:24.320
Oh no! I was in the middle of an errand!

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:26.660
Then see you tomorrow.

00:16:32.270 --> 00:16:33.480
Safe.

00:16:46.550 --> 00:16:51.320
You know, you should only laugh when happy things happen.

00:16:59.270 --> 00:17:00.110
Later.

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:10.650
In the end, I just kept getting into fights with Aoi.

00:17:10.650 --> 00:17:14.020
Hiyama! Hurry down here!

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:15.280
Okay!

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:34.420
I don't really understand how Hiyama came to like me.

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:36.480
But...

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:41.010
Doesn't everyone fit that requirement?

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:49.690
But I'm sure he likes me for who I am.

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:54.600
That's why I like him, too.

00:17:56.040 --> 00:18:01.070
You don't need to think about it that much.

00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:03.690
I don't know what to talk about.

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:09.160
Anything works, like what happened today at school or what's going on at home.

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:11.400
That's what bothering me the most.

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:16.610
You just have to stay at her side, then. No need to force yourself to talk.

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:19.000
That's what liking someone is all about.

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:21.240
Another new quote!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:22.880
Got it!

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:25.730
Takao!

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:32.490
What did you want to talk to me about?

00:18:32.490 --> 00:18:34.820
Um, you know...

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:38.700
What part of me do you like?

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:42.020
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:46.420
Well, I guess it's because you're just like a puppy.

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:49.040
I knew it.

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:50.720
Why do you look so down?

00:18:51.840 --> 00:18:55.670
That just means I'm like a pet.

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:57.190
Maybe.

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:03.080
But who gives a pet a necklace?

00:19:07.530 --> 00:19:09.490
Can I ask you, too?

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:13.790
What part of me do you like?

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:16.620
Um, uh...

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:21.760
You have lots of good points, so I don't really understand.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:24.710
But I love you, Takao!

00:19:25.550 --> 00:19:26.620
Me too.

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:31.110
I like myself.

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:36.040
Just kidding.

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:43.620
Aoi! Sorry to make you wait!

00:19:48.550 --> 00:19:50.090
Hey, hey.

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:02.830
Oh well.

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:12.180
Let's go home together, too.

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:13.160
Okay.

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:23.310
Don't cry all by yourself now.

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:27.140
I'm with you all the way.

00:20:30.550 --> 00:20:31.680
Aoi.

00:20:32.030 --> 00:20:33.190
What did you do?

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:36.840
Did you write stuff on my face!?

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:37.960
Huh!?

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:40.770
You're such a child, Hiyama!

00:20:40.770 --> 00:20:44.270
I didn't do anything! Your expression is funny enough already!

00:20:44.270 --> 00:20:45.350
Huh?

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:54.120
He may be a bit awkward, but he tries his best.

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:58.000
His mouth may run a bit, but he's actually very kind.

00:20:58.840 --> 00:21:03.560
I want to find out more about his good points.

00:22:39.630 --> 00:22:42.810
Is your mom a bit careless?

00:22:42.810 --> 00:22:46.410
Yeah, she always forgets about what to buy.

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:49.170
"Kazuma, can you buy this for me?"

00:22:49.170 --> 00:22:50.760
What a pain.

00:22:51.410 --> 00:22:52.910
Kazuma...

00:22:55.810 --> 00:23:00.250
So your mom calls you by your first name.

00:23:01.040 --> 00:23:02.120
Yeah.

00:23:03.050 --> 00:23:04.640
What is this?

00:23:04.640 --> 00:23:08.240
Hearing the word Kazuma makes my heart beat so fast.

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:11.580
It's nothing.

00:23:11.580 --> 00:23:15.600
I just never heard about anyone calling you by your last name.

00:23:15.600 --> 00:23:17.470
It just feels fresh.

00:23:17.470 --> 00:23:21.210
Oh yeah, everyone calls me Hiyama.

00:23:21.210 --> 00:23:24.320
I see, it does sound a bit weird.

00:23:24.600 --> 00:23:27.130
No, that's not it.

00:23:28.160 --> 00:23:30.730
Aoi Yui, age 12.

00:23:30.820 --> 00:23:35.590
I look up a bit to those who can call each other by their first names.

00:23:41.570 --> 00:23:43.300
Ayase, what's up/

00:23:43.300 --> 00:23:44.850
You want to challenge me?

00:23:44.850 --> 00:23:47.540
Whoever loses has to listen to whoever wins.

00:23:47.540 --> 00:23:49.600
I get it. I accept your challenge.

00:23:49.600 --> 00:23:53.150
So what kind of prize do you want if you win?

00:23:53.150 --> 00:23:56.140
Next time we'll make your hearts throb again.
